<name>Air Conditioner</name>
<ttl id="1002K_S000B_7421V_T0025" variety="T0025">
<name>Heater &amp; Air Conditioner System</name>
<para id="RM000002BH6006X" category="C" type-id="300BA" name-id="522Q9-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>B1422/22</dtccode>
<dtcname>Compressor lock detected</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002BH6006X_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EPW00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The lock sensor is installed in the cooler compressor w/ magnetic clutch assembly and sends a signal of the compressor speed to the air conditioner amplifier assembly. The air conditioner amplifier assembly detects compressor lock from the difference between compressor speed and engine speed. When the compressor locks, the A/C indicator light blinks at 1 second intervals.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.90in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.10in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Malfunction Duration</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B1422/22</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When cooler compressor w/ magnetic clutch assembly is operating</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the difference between compressor speed/pulley ratio and engine speed deviates by 80% or more for 3 +/- 1 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Current malfunction only</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Cooler Compressor w/ Magnetic Clutch Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire harness and connector (air conditioner amplifier assembly - cooler compressor w/ magnetic clutch assembly)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Air Conditioner Amplifier Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002BH6006X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EPX00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E155259J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002BH6006X_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002BH6006X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000002BH6006X_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EQ000000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Air Conditioner Amplifier Assembly - Cooler Compressor w/ Magnetic Clutch Assembly)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D702RX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the air conditioner amplifier assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector B of the cooler compressor w/ magnetic clutch assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E155262J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the vehicle side wire harness connector terminal and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.75in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B1(SSR+) - A8(LOCK)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B2(SSR-) - A13(SG-2)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B1 (SSR+) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B2 (SSR-) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A14 (GND) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BH6006X_04_0001" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002BH6006X_04_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BH6006X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EPY00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Air Conditioner Amplifier Assembly (SG-2 Terminal)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect connector A of the air conditioner amplifier assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect connector B of the cooler compressor w/ magnetic clutch assembly.</ptxt>
